WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.529 --> 00:00:13.767
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BRETT KAVANAUGH AND

00:00:09.663 --> 00:00:14.568
HIS WIFE ASHLEY APPEARED ON

00:00:14.034 --> 00:00:15.803
"THE STORY" WITH

00:00:14.701 --> 00:00:18.038
MARTHA MacCALLUM AN HOUR AGO

00:00:15.936 --> 00:00:19.773
AND HE DENIED ALL ALLEGATIONS OF

00:00:18.439 --> 00:00:23.143
SEXUAL MISCONDUCT RALLIED

00:00:19.907 --> 00:00:24.678
AGAINST HIM.

00:00:23.277 --> 00:00:25.646
&gt;&gt; Judge Kavanaugh: I'VE NEVER

00:00:24.812 --> 00:00:27.981
SEXUALLY ASSAULTED ANYONE, NOT

00:00:25.779 --> 00:00:29.349
IN HIGH SCHOOL, NOT EVER.

00:00:28.115 --> 00:00:30.350
I'VE TREATED EVERYONE WITH

00:00:29.483 --> 00:00:31.285
DIGNITY AND RESPECT.

00:00:30.484 --> 00:00:33.387
LISTEN TO PEOPLE WHO HAVE KNOWN

00:00:31.418 --> 00:00:36.056
THE BEST FOR MY WHOLE LIFE, THE

00:00:33.887 --> 00:00:38.325
WOMEN WHO HAVE KNOWN ME SINCE

00:00:37.491 --> 00:00:39.993
HIGH SCHOOL.

00:00:38.459 --> 00:00:41.462
THEY SIGNED A LETTER FROM

00:00:40.127 --> 00:00:43.797
HIGH SCHOOL SAYING I ALWAYS

00:00:41.595 --> 00:00:44.131
TREATED THEM WITH DIGNITY AND

00:00:43.931 --> 00:00:47.201
RESPECT.

00:00:44.264 --> 00:00:48.369
&gt;&gt; Tucker: KAVANAUGH'S WIFE

00:00:47.334 --> 00:00:50.738
CAME TO HIS DEFENSE AS WELL.

00:00:48.502 --> 00:00:54.708
&gt;&gt; I KNOW BRETT, I'VE KNOWN HIM

00:00:50.871 --> 00:00:56.644
FOR 17 YEARS AND THIS IS NOT AT

00:00:54.842 --> 00:00:56.977
ALL -- IT'S REALLY HARD TO

00:00:56.777 --> 00:00:59.680
BELIEVE.

00:00:57.111 --> 00:01:00.881
HE'S DECENT AND KIND AND GOOD, I

00:00:59.813 --> 00:01:04.718
AND I KNOW HIS HEART.

00:01:01.015 --> 00:01:07.788
THIS IS NOT CONSISTENT WITH

00:01:04.852 --> 00:01:08.088
BREAD.

00:01:07.921 --> 00:01:11.325
BRETT.

00:01:08.222 --> 00:01:11.625
&gt;&gt; THEY LOOK IN PAIN, BOTH OF

00:01:11.458 --> 00:01:13.160
THEM.

00:01:11.759 --> 00:01:13.994
&gt;&gt; Martha: WATCHING IT AGAIN,

00:01:13.293 --> 00:01:15.929
THIS IS REALLY HARD FOR THEM AND

00:01:14.128 --> 00:01:17.598
I FELT LIKE THEY WERE BOTH KIND

00:01:16.063 --> 00:01:19.900
OF JUST TAMPING DOWN THE TEARS.

00:01:17.732 --> 00:01:24.138
THEY WERE THIS CLOSE TO CRYING.

00:01:20.034 --> 00:01:24.972
I THINK THIS IS OBVIOUSLY

00:01:24.271 --> 00:01:25.373
INCREDIBLY EMOTIONALLY

00:01:25.106 --> 00:01:27.375
DEVASTATING.

00:01:25.506 --> 00:01:28.342
I THINK THEY THOUGHT AND WE ALL

00:01:27.508 --> 00:01:29.577
THOUGHT THAT FIRST DAY AT THE

00:01:28.476 --> 00:01:30.811
HEARING WHEN DEMOCRATS TRIED TO

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:32.279
SHUT DOWN THE WHOLE HEARING THAT

00:01:30.945 --> 00:01:33.247
IT COULDN'T REALLY GET ANY WORSE

00:01:32.413 --> 00:01:35.182
THAN THAT, THEN THEY THINK THEY

00:01:33.381 --> 00:01:36.784
ARE ALL THE WAY THROUGH AND

00:01:35.316 --> 00:01:37.618
SUDDENLY THOSE ACCUSATIONS START

00:01:36.917 --> 00:01:40.488
COMING OUT OF THE WOODWORK.

00:01:37.985 --> 00:01:40.821
I THINK IT WOULD WREAK HAVOC ON

00:01:40.621 --> 00:01:43.090
ANYBODY.

00:01:40.955 --> 00:01:44.959
THEY SEEM VERY SOLID TOGETHER

00:01:43.224 --> 00:01:46.994
AND VERY UNITED IN THE EFFORT.

00:01:45.092 --> 00:01:48.963
I SAID TO THEM, AT SOME POINT

00:01:47.128 --> 00:01:50.798
DON'T YOU SAY, FORGET IT.

00:01:49.096 --> 00:01:51.899
IT'S NOT WORTH IT ANYMORE, IT'S

00:01:50.931 --> 00:01:56.203
TOO PAINFUL.

00:01:52.032 --> 00:01:56.904
BUT THAT'S NOT AN OPTION.

00:01:56.337 --> 00:02:00.941
&gt;&gt; Tucker: FOR A JOB THAT PAYS

00:01:57.038 --> 00:02:01.308
LESS THAN THE AVERAGE LAWYER

00:02:01.075 --> 00:02:02.309
SOMETIMES.

00:02:01.442 --> 00:02:04.145
&gt;&gt; IT'S VERY DIFFICULT TO HAVE

00:02:02.443 --> 00:02:06.447
THESE CONVERSATIONS WITH YOUR

00:02:04.278 --> 00:02:08.315
CHILDREN, WHICH WE HAVE HAD TO

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:11.118
HAVE.

00:02:08.449 --> 00:02:12.586
ON BROADER TERMS, FOR OUR

00:02:11.252 --> 00:02:14.388
YOUNGEST.

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:16.524
BUT THEY KNOW, IT'S BRETT AND

00:02:14.522 --> 00:02:18.559
THAT THEY THE TRUTH.

00:02:16.657 --> 00:02:20.761
AND WE TOLD THEM AT THE

00:02:18.692 --> 00:02:22.563
BEGINNING OF THIS PROCESS, THIS

00:02:20.895 --> 00:02:24.465
WILL BE NOT FUN SOMETIMES.

00:02:22.696 --> 00:02:25.967
PEOPLE FEEL STRONGLY AND YOU

00:02:24.599 --> 00:02:28.903
NEED TO KNOW THAT.

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:31.572
JUST REMEMBER, YOU KNOW YOUR DA

00:02:29.036 --> 00:02:33.574
DAD.

00:02:31.706 --> 00:02:35.009
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I BET THOSE GIRLS

00:02:33.708 --> 00:02:36.777
WERE NOT PREPARED FOR THIS.

00:02:35.143 --> 00:02:38.112
&gt;&gt; Martha: HOW COULD THEY BE?

00:02:36.911 --> 00:02:41.349
YOU CAN IMAGINE AT THEIR AGE,

00:02:38.246 --> 00:02:43.584
THEY ARE AT AGES TEN AND 12 IN

00:02:41.482 --> 00:02:44.752
THAT AGE, I'M SURE IT'S

00:02:43.718 --> 00:02:46.387
DEVASTATING FOR THEM.

00:02:44.886 --> 00:02:47.956
I ASKED HIM SPECIFICALLY POINT

00:02:46.521 --> 00:02:48.990
BLANK ABOUT ALL OF THE

00:02:48.089 --> 00:02:50.992
ALLEGATIONS AND WE TALKED ABOUT

00:02:49.123 --> 00:02:51.359
THEM IN VERY SPECIFIC, GRAPHIC

00:02:51.125 --> 00:02:53.027
TERMS.

00:02:51.492 --> 00:02:57.131
I CAN'T IMAGINE WHAT IT'S LIKE

00:02:53.161 --> 00:02:59.133
TO KIND OF FRAME THAT ISSUE, BUT

00:02:57.265 --> 00:02:59.968
SHE ALSO SAID, THEY KNOW THEIR

00:02:59.267 --> 00:03:00.969
DAD.

00:03:00.101 --> 00:03:02.337
EVEN IN THE BEGINNING WHEN HE

00:03:01.102 --> 00:03:03.104
GOT ROUGHED UP IN THAT FIRST

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:08.877
DAY, HE SAID HIS DAUGHTER CAME

00:03:03.238 --> 00:03:09.944
DOWN AND GAVE THEM A HUG THAT

00:03:09.010 --> 00:03:11.279
NIGHT.

00:03:10.078 --> 00:03:15.250
AND THE ALLEGATIONS ARE WHAT

00:03:11.413 --> 00:03:18.987
THEY ARE, HE'S GOING TO FACE

00:03:15.383 --> 00:03:21.089
THAT ON THURSDAY.

00:03:19.287 --> 00:03:21.790
THERE IS NO DOUBT THAT THIS HAS

00:03:21.223 --> 00:03:25.560
BEEN EXTRAORDINARILY DIFFICULT

00:03:21.923 --> 00:03:27.262
FOR THEM.

00:03:25.694 --> 00:03:28.763
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHEN CLARENCE

00:03:27.395 --> 00:03:29.664
THOMAS WAS APPROVED AND OF

00:03:28.897 --> 00:03:31.032
INAPPROPRIATE BEHAVIOR IN 1991,

00:03:29.798 --> 00:03:33.068
HE MADE A DECISION THAT HE WAS

00:03:31.166 --> 00:03:34.002
GOING TO FIGHT BACK IN A VERY

00:03:33.201 --> 00:03:36.771
TOUGH WAY.

00:03:34.135 --> 00:03:37.506
HE WAS NOT GOING TO GO DOWN.

00:03:36.905 --> 00:03:44.679
DO YOU THINK KAVANAUGH HAS MADE

00:03:37.639 --> 00:03:45.347
THAT DECISION?

00:03:44.813 --> 00:03:46.448
&gt;&gt; Martha: KAVANAUGH WAS NOT

00:03:45.847 --> 00:03:49.384
IN CLARENCE THOMAS FIGHTING

00:03:46.581 --> 00:03:50.151
SHAPE TODAY.

00:03:49.518 --> 00:03:51.953
AND WHEN HE BASICALLY LEVELED

00:03:50.285 --> 00:03:52.921
THE SENATE JUDICIARY COMMITTEE,

00:03:52.087 --> 00:03:54.556
IT'S SO POWERFUL.

00:03:53.054 --> 00:03:55.557
THAT'S NOT THE FRAME OF MIND

00:03:54.689 --> 00:03:57.092
THAT BRETT KAVANAUGH APPEARED TO

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:59.361
BE IN TODAY, ALTHOUGH HE MAY BE

00:03:57.225 --> 00:04:00.829
THAT MOOD ON THURSDAY.

00:03:59.494 --> 00:04:02.831
HE ASKED HIM SEVERAL TIMES, YOU

00:04:00.962 --> 00:04:04.466
SAY THIS IS ALL FALSE, SO WHAT

00:04:02.964 --> 00:04:06.134
DO YOU THINK IS BEHIND THIS?

00:04:04.599 --> 00:04:06.635
WHERE DO YOU THINK THIS IS

00:04:06.268 --> 00:04:09.104
COMING FROM?

00:04:06.768 --> 00:04:10.272
IS THERE SOME KIND OF POLITICAL

00:04:09.237 --> 00:04:11.373
VENDETTA AGAINST YOU THAT'S

00:04:10.405 --> 00:04:12.307
BEING PLAYED OUT?

00:04:11.506 --> 00:04:14.009
WE ALL KNOW THE CORNERS THAT

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:16.211
COULD BE COMING FROM BUT HE DID

00:04:14.476 --> 00:04:17.979
NOT WANT TO GO THERE AT ALL.

00:04:16.344 --> 00:04:19.781
HE DOESN'T WANT TO CONJECTURE

00:04:18.113 --> 00:04:20.582
ABOUT ANY OF THAT.

00:04:19.915 --> 00:04:22.584
AND CLARENCE THOMAS CLEARLY

00:04:20.715 --> 00:04:22.851
CALLED IT WHAT HE THOUGHT IT

00:04:22.717 --> 00:04:26.054
WAS.

00:04:22.984 --> 00:04:26.721
A HIGH-TECH LYNCHING AND HE

00:04:26.188 --> 00:04:28.323
THOUGHT THE SENATE JUDICIARY

00:04:26.855 --> 00:04:30.358
COMMITTEE HAD SUNK TO SUCH LOWS

00:04:28.456 --> 00:04:31.626
TO ENTERTAIN SOME OF THE

00:04:30.592 --> 00:04:32.594
ACCUSATIONS AGAINST HIM, THAT

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:34.996
THEY ENTERTAINED.

00:04:32.727 --> 00:04:35.397
THAT WAS HIS FEELING, AND THEY

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:36.631
PERSEVERED.

